<title>USA: RMH Teleservices names Rosoff chairman.</title>
<headline>RMH Teleservices names Rosoff chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BRYN MAWR, Pa. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>RMH Teleservices Inc said on Wednesday that its board of directors has elected William Rosoff chairman.</p>
<p>Rosoff, who currently serves as vice chairman of Advanta Corp, will serve as director and chairman during the remainder of the unexpired term of Anthony Brenner, RMH said.</p>
<p>Brenner has resigned as chairman to pursue other business and professional interests, the company said.</p>
</text>
